# name | tier | description
# tier:  b = basic (pre-selected)   e = extra (optional)   h = heavy / big download
zsh|b|Shell Nebula runs in (required for the UI)
git|b|Version control (handy; updates use GitHub directly)
gawk|b|Text engine Nebula uses for charts and rendering
jq|b|Reads live data for crypto and sports dashboards
curl|b|Used by weather, news, crypto, ip, define
tgpt|b|The engine behind Nebula AI (ask, joke, fact)
openssl-tool|b|Hashes your login password
lsd|b|Icon-rich ls / ll / la
espeak|b|Nebula AI voice (text-to-speech)
sox|e|UI sound effects
mpg123|e|Tiny MP3 player for `play`
mpv|h|Plays every audio format for `play`
neofetch|e|System info panel
ripgrep|e|Fast text search
fd|e|Fast file search
file|e|File type detection for ls icons
termux-api|e|Phone TTS fallback (needs Termux:API app)
zsh-completions|e|Extra tab completions
figlet|e|Big text banners
tree|e|Directory tree view
htop|e|Process viewer
wget|e|Downloader
unzip|e|Archive extraction
nano|e|Simple text editor
python|e|Python runtime
tmux|e|Terminal multiplexer
neovim|e|Modern vim editor
openssh|e|SSH client/server
whois|e|Domain lookup
dnsutils|e|dig / nslookup
inetutils|e|ping, ftp, telnet tools
tsu|e|su wrapper for rooted devices
dos2unix|e|Line-ending converter
zstd|e|Zstandard compression
tidy|e|HTML tidy
ncdu|e|Disk usage explorer
bmon|e|Bandwidth monitor
gum|e|Pretty shell prompts
byobu|h|Tmux/screen front-end
cmatrix|h|Matrix rain (fun)
hollywood|h|Hacker-movie screen (fun, big)
ffmpeg|h|Audio/video toolkit (big)
pulseaudio|h|Audio server (big)
proot|h|Userspace chroot
proot-distro|h|Linux distros in Termux (big)
